  "body": "## Changes\r\n\r\n* fix: show plugin display names and dim file extensions in plugin prompts (#1301)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Install\r\n\r\nRun `dprint upgrade` or see https://dprint.dev/install/\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nThese artifacts have [build provenance attestations](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/using-artifact-attestations/using-artifact-attestations-to-establish-provenance-for-builds).\r\nVerify a download with the [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/):\r\n\r\n```shell\r\ngh attestation verify dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip --repo dprint/dprint\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Checksums\r\n\r\n|Artifact|SHA-256 Checksum|\r\n|:--|:--|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-apple-darwin.zip|551fd5b0ce32a83682f6aaa425317db54402451a0ab66b46c0e11e17900f7db8|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-apple-darwin.zip|b495103be1c01ba097449d73af3d76bbcef3deb291b87e9b7db6e8d12d497ef6|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|52f0ee9742df4b56ddffdd058a066153f3a8fea5456be5a9e19f2da10bd80b8b|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc-installer.exe|98f7e0af79793e5b7f6fba0535312dd20fb0be1eea77b0d239862930a29895b0|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|499463bf77cb83a0ebbfa0e4af84ba00c58ae6ae991b4d465c41a1679ae404af|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|5612c587a34dfbbda37162d46755f9e8c6a4efba7950920b2a308ea84ce0886a|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|c4e5e8491f52971f8e3bd0ed80995eafd9119fbe603ba626694a20d56c14a730|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|03fd8908f9b418bdc4701347ff0527a59d1c08db2bc09a9f5d8101eb711e7fe2|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|9b537fdfb75b2402f47d15cc615f1ba31736a37e2aed65662e8d9d4b647c70f1|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|bdc9ef53dde39831a47aa74ace0143d82dbb463b55bdd9bb835786d2f5027b9a|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|f0ab7c56d08611740c346a53185488ee237ab56ac328283b4e3b456f821b71aa|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|022e540ad9c45e2ad8d5e95c87543316d6b19af4b6f51697d0731885c8add339|\r\n|dprint-powerpc64le-unknown-linux